 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Four days he lay in the Bethany tomb",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The mourners wept in every room",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.06,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Martha ran out to meet him on the road",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Carrying a sorrow too heavy to hold",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lord, if you had been here, my brother would not have died",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Your brother will rise again",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am the resurrection and the life",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoever believes in me will live, even though he dies",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Everyone who lives and believes in me will never die",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do you believe this?",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He came up to the cave with the stone laid across",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And Jesus wept beside them as they grieved for their loss",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then he lifted up his eyes and he thanked the Father there",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And his voice like thunder went ringing through the air",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lazarus, come out!",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 1.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Unbind him and let him go",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Yes, Lord. I believe that you are the Christ",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Son of God",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am the resurrection and the life",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoever believes in me will live, even though he dies",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
